              },
              "options": {
                "mode": "markdown",
                "content": "### Not shown here: the link-checker\nDead-link checking (`utils/linkChecker.js`) hits arbitrary third-party hosts per citation, not one rate-limitable service — a 429 from *some* site doesn't mean *this app* is being throttled the way a 429 from XAI/MediaWiki/Pixabay does. It's tracked in the **Pipeline & External APIs** dashboard's outcome breakdown instead, not here.\n\nThese three (XAI, MediaWiki, Pixabay) are the complete set of real outbound third-party dependencies this app has — confirmed by grepping every `fetch(` call in the codebase, not from memory."
              }
            }
          }
        }
